gin":"YuanTingHsieh","id":13113932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTEzOTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13113932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh","html_url":"https://github.com/YuanTingHsieh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T20:32:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T20:32:27Z","body":"@Vithor112 \n\nThanks for reporting!\n\nIt looks like we have a bug in the GPU option translation code for `nvflare poc`.\n\n`nvflare poc start -gpu 0` is intended to assign host GPU device `0` to the POC client. In Docker mode, this should be translated to Docker’s device syntax, for example:\n\n    --gpus '\"device=0\"'\n\nHowever, the current code translates it as:\n\n    --gpus=0\n\nwhich does not correctly select GPU device `0` for the container.\n\nWe will fix this in the next release. Thanks again for catching this.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/comments/4316169061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]